 "cells": [
  {
   "file": "cells/intro.json",
   "id": "intro",
   "kind": "markdown",
   "markdown": "# A damped oscillator\n\nA mass on a spring, with friction. Its displacement is\n\n\n\n```math\nx(t) = e^{-\\zeta \\omega t} \\cos\\left(\\omega \\sqrt{1-\\zeta^2}\\, t\\right)\n```\n\n\n\nwhere ``\\omega`` is the natural frequency and ``\\zeta`` the damping ratio. Drag the slider to change\nthe damping.",
   "native": true,
   "output": true,
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "file": "cells/controls.json",
   "hidecode": true,
   "id": "controls",
   "kind": "code",
   "output": true,
   "source": "@bind zeta Slider(0.02:0.02:0.6; default = 0.1)",
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "hidecode": false,
   "id": "model",
   "kind": "code",
   "output": false,
   "source": "ω = 2π\nts = collect(range(0, 6; length = 400))\nx(t, ζ) = exp(-ζ * ω * t) * cos(ω * sqrt(1 - ζ^2) * t)\nhalflife = log(2) / (zeta * ω)\nnothing",
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "file": "cells/halflife_md.json",
   "id": "halflife_md",
   "kind": "markdown",
   "markdown": "At ζ = 0.1 the amplitude falls to half in 1.1 seconds.",
   "native": false,
   "output": true,
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "file": "cells/trace.json",
   "hidecode": false,
   "id": "trace",
   "kind": "code",
   "output": true,
   "source": "echart(:line, ts, @replay(zeta, [x(t, zeta) for t in ts]);\n       name = \"x(t)\", showSymbol = false,\n       xAxis = (type = :value, name = \"t (s)\"), yAxis = (type = :value, min = -1, max = 1))",
   "tags": [
    "macrocall"
   ]
  },
  {
   "file": "cells/table_md.json",
   "id": "table_md",
   "kind": "markdown",
   "markdown": "## Peaks\n\nEach successive peak is smaller by the same factor, so the peaks alone tell you the damping.",
   "native": true,
   "output": true,
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "file": "cells/peaks.json",
   "hidecode": false,
   "id": "peaks",
   "kind": "code",
   "output": true,
   "source": "T = 2π / (ω * sqrt(1 - zeta^2))\nslate_table([(peak = k, time = round(k * T; digits = 3), height = round(exp(-zeta * ω * k * T); digits = 4)) for k in 0:6])",
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "file": "cells/next.json",
   "id": "next",
   "kind": "markdown",
   "markdown": "## Driving it\n\nPush the oscillator periodically instead of letting it ring down, and it responds most strongly near\nits natural frequency: [Resonance](resonance.jl).",
   "native": true,
   "output": true,
   "tags": []
  }
 ],
